  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT THE DEVELOPMENT OF A MONITORING, EVALUATION AND LEARNING (MEL) SYSTEM, FRAMEWORK AND TOOLKIT THAT WILL HELP PEPY IMPROVE ACCOUNTABILITY AND CO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main expected outcome of the project is the development of a Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL) system, framework and toolkit that will help PEPY improve accountability and consistency, and identify technical and programmatic gaps effectively. Ireland&#x2019;s funding will support the recruitment of a national consultant that will work with PEPY through a series of consultations and workshops. A robust retrospective and prospective MEL system is essential to help PEPY deliver its new five-year strategic plan.</narrative>
  </description>
